msgstr "L'exploitant de ce serveur n'a pas publié ce document."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/legal/presentation/messages/legal-settings.messages.ts:10
msgid "The organization or the person that runs this server. The legal notice shows these fields above its text."
